  "published": "2026-07-22T20:56:17.27Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "--- 8.1.2.1 ---\n\t\t\tMediaSource now copies the streams timebase into the CodecContexts timebase.\n\t\t\tThe CodecContexts timebase is writen into the frame if the  frame's timebase's numerator is 0.\n\t\t\t=== 8.1.2 ===\n\t\t\tUpdate to ffmpeg 8.1.2 \"Hoarse\".\n\t\t\tFormatContext was split into DemuxerContext and MuxerContext.\n\t\t\tMediaSource no longer thread-safe. It doesn't make sense to make it thread-safe as most of the time it will only be called from one thread.\n\t\t\tUpdate dependencies.",
